Fix (2026-11-16, #70): all 0157 addresses were Mach-O file offsets, not NSO
vaddrs — patch_nso.py indexes its image by NSO vaddr, so the CUTS assert
failed (0x797314 held a stp prologue, fd7b01a9, not the tbz). Every 0157
address is now the NSO vaddr (file offset - 0x300000): CUTS tbz 0x497314,
FRAME_STEP title setup 0x4972f4, Decide 0x1d78f8, Table A/B 0xec8270/
0xec8288, re-encoded adrp page 0x120d000, List::setText 0x1d6b70.
Verified on host: patch_nso.py rewrite of main 1.4.1 exits 0 (cuts 6),
frame-step test 0 failures.
